+# Regime: WHICH FORWARD produced a scored position (issue tessera#102).
+# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
+#: ``prefill``  -- every scored position comes from one many-row forward over
+#:                 the whole chunk (``prompt_logprobs`` over a 512-token
